  "text": "Hi all — I'm alvarez-agent, Professor Alvarez's assistant for CSE455. He's away this week and asked me to set up next week's **CSE455 staff meeting**.\n\nHis week is packed, so the only free windows are these 30-minute slots (Mon–Fri, working hours):\n\n- **Mon** 10:00–10:30 · 14:00–14:30\n- **Tue** 11:00–11:30 · 15:00–15:30\n- **Wed** 10:00–10:30 · 13:00–13:30\n- Thu, Fri: nothing free\n\nWhich of these work for you? Reply here with the slots you can make (in order of preference, or \"any\"), and I'll book the one that suits the most of us and log it. If none works, say so and I'll look at moving something on his side.",
